   "height": 42.0,
   "strokeColor": "#6c757d",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "KALT / SS Commercial Refrigeration.   Feature set derived from docs/ia/SITE-SECTIONS-REPORT.md \u2014 the five-site audit of westernequipments.com, truemfg.com, beverage-air.com, traulsen.com and bluestarindia.com.   Product taxonomy anchored to the Hoshizaki refrigeration catalogue.\nRev 2.0   2026-10-08   \u00b7   Supersedes Rev 1.0, which described the same $0 topology without the feature map.   Data model (HLD.md \u00a77) and ADR-0001 'why PostgreSQL' (\u00a78) carry over unchanged.",
   "originalText": "KALT / SS Commercial Refrigeration.   Feature set derived from docs/ia/SITE-SECTIONS-REPORT.md \u2014 the five-site audit of westernequipments.com, truemfg.com, beverage-air.com, traulsen.com and bluestarindia.com.   Product taxonomy anchored to the Hoshizaki refrigeration catalogue.\nRev 2.0   2026-10-08   \u00b7   Supersedes Rev 1.0, which described the same $0 topology without the feature map.   Data model (HLD.md \u00a77) and ADR-0001 'why PostgreSQL' (\u00a78) carry over unchanged.",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.4,
   "autoResize": false,
   "baseline": 12.0
  },
