   "id": "el-0004",
   "seed": 2130544070,
   "versionNonce": 1117153375,
   "type": "text",
   "x": 14,
   "y": 128.12,
   "width": 2892,
   "height": 23.18,
   "strokeColor": "#1a1d23",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "THE ONE PRINCIPLE \u2014 every page funnels to a single action: AN ENQUIRY.  There is no checkout.",
   "originalText": "THE ONE PRINCIPLE \u2014 every page funnels to a single action: AN ENQUIRY.  There is no checkout.",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.22,
   "autoResize": false,
   "baseline": 15.200000000000001
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "version": 1,
   "id": "el-0005",
   "seed": 551942410,
   "versionNonce": 1754975484,
   "type": "text",
   "x": 14,
   "y": 159.3,
   "width": 2892,
   "height": 36.92,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "Not one of the five audited sites publishes a price. Every path through every one of them terminates in \"request a quote\", \"find a dealer\" or \"contact us\". That makes the enquiry the only conversion event on the site, and it is the only write path that carries revenue \u2014 so it gets the outbox, the retries and the synthetic probe (\u00a76), while everything else is a static file served from a CDN edge.\nRead every box below as: what does this page need in order to produce an enquiry, and what does it cost to serve.",
   "originalText": "Not one of the five audited sites publishes a price. Every path through every one of them terminates in \"request a quote\", \"find a dealer\" or \"contact us\". That makes the enquiry the only conversion event on the site, and it is the only write path that carries revenue \u2014 so it gets the outbox, the retries and the synthetic probe (\u00a76), while everything else is a static file served from a CDN edge.\nRead every box below as: what does this page need in order to produce an enquiry, and what does it cost to serve.",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.42,
   "autoResize": false,
   "baseline": 10.4
  },
