   "fontSize": 11.5,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "text": "11 blocks: utility bar \u00b7 5-item nav + products mega-menu \u00b7 ONE static\nhero (NOT a 5-slide carousel, slides 2+ are not seen) \u00b7 shop-by-type\n6-card grid \u00b7 shop-by-industry rail \u00b7 why-us NUMBER tiles \u00b7 CLIENT\nLOGO STRIP \u00b7 featured models \u00b7 service promise \u00b7 enquiry band \u00b7 footer\nRENDER  SSG at build\nREADS   MDX + 6 category rows",
   "originalText": "11 blocks: utility bar \u00b7 5-item nav + products mega-menu \u00b7 ONE static\nhero (NOT a 5-slide carousel, slides 2+ are not seen) \u00b7 shop-by-type\n6-card grid \u00b7 shop-by-industry rail \u00b7 why-us NUMBER tiles \u00b7 CLIENT\nLOGO STRIP \u00b7 featured models \u00b7 service promise \u00b7 enquiry band \u00b7 footer\nRENDER  SSG at build\nREADS   MDX + 6 category rows",
