   "fontFamily": 3,
   "text": "6 category cards mapped 1:1 to the Hoshizaki range (\u00a72) \u00b7 a second row\nfor adjacent lines you carry \u00b7 filter entry point \u00b7 one big\n\"Download full catalogue (PDF)\" \u2014 what distributors actually want.\nA flat list of 300 model codes is unusable; all five use a grid.\nRENDER  SSG\nREADS   categories + model counts",
   "originalText": "6 category cards mapped 1:1 to the Hoshizaki range (\u00a72) \u00b7 a second row\nfor adjacent lines you carry \u00b7 filter entry point \u00b7 one big\n\"Download full catalogue (PDF)\" \u2014 what distributors actually want.\nA flat list of 300 model codes is unusable; all five use a grid.\nRENDER  SSG\nREADS   categories + model counts",
