   "text": "Hero copy (concrete, not corporate) \u00b7 sub-type blocks \u00b7 model grid \u00b7\nfilter sidebar (\u00a74) \u00b7 COMPARISON TABLE \u2014 none of the five do this\nwell, so it is the easiest place to beat them \u00b7 related industries \u00b7\n\"not sure which model?\" \u2192 enquiry with the category pre-filled\nRENDER  ISR, on-demand revalidation only\nREADS   catalog",
