   "fontSize": 11.5,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "text": "ONE page, six ANCHORED sections \u2014 not six thin pages:\nRestaurants, QSR & cloud kitchens \u00b7 Bakery, patisserie &\nconfectionery \u00b7 Supermarket & retail \u00b7 Hotels, banqueting &\ninstitutional \u00b7 Healthcare & pharma \u00b7 Ice cream, dairy & beverage\nBuyers self-identify by business type, not by equipment category.\nRENDER  SSG      READS  MDX + product industry tags",
   "originalText": "ONE page, six ANCHORED sections \u2014 not six thin pages:\nRestaurants, QSR & cloud kitchens \u00b7 Bakery, patisserie &\nconfectionery \u00b7 Supermarket & retail \u00b7 Hotels, banqueting &\ninstitutional \u00b7 Healthcare & pharma \u00b7 Ice cream, dairy & beverage\nBuyers self-identify by business type, not by equipment category.\nRENDER  SSG      READS  MDX + product industry tags",
