   "fontFamily": 3,
   "text": "ONE page, not the six the audited sites fragment it into:\nwho we are \u00b7 NUMBERS not adjectives \u00b7 manufacturing & plant photos \u00b7\nCERTIFICATIONS, ISO/BIS/CE \u2014 frequently the deciding document in an\nIndian tender \u00b7 R&D \u00b7 sustainability \u00b7 Hoshizaki association\nRENDER  SSG\nREADS   MDX",
