   "fontSize": 11.5,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "text": "ONE page. Do NOT copy True's ~25-URL support tree \u2014 that exists\nbecause they have decades of installed base, and you have none yet.\nHelpline FIRST \u00b7 installation \u00b7 AMC \u00b7 genuine spares \u00b7 warranty\ntable \u00b7 service CITY LIST \u00b7 service request form \u00b7 FAQ\nRENDER  SSG + form POST\nREADS   MDX + faq rows",
   "originalText": "ONE page. Do NOT copy True's ~25-URL support tree \u2014 that exists\nbecause they have decades of installed base, and you have none yet.\nHelpline FIRST \u00b7 installation \u00b7 AMC \u00b7 genuine spares \u00b7 warranty\ntable \u00b7 service CITY LIST \u00b7 service request form \u00b7 FAQ\nRENDER  SSG + form POST\nREADS   MDX + faq rows",
