   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fontSize": 11.5,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "text": "Every other page on the site is a funnel into this form.\n9 fields MAX \u00b7 enquiry-type dropdown \u00b7 model pre-filled from the\nproduct page \u00b7 phone + WhatsApp beside the form, because a large\nshare of Indian B2B buyers will not fill a form \u00b7 offices + GSTIN \u00b7\nseparate dealership form\nWRITES  lead + lead_item[] + outbox, in ONE txn.  See \u00a76.",
   "originalText": "Every other page on the site is a funnel into this form.\n9 fields MAX \u00b7 enquiry-type dropdown \u00b7 model pre-filled from the\nproduct page \u00b7 phone + WhatsApp beside the form, because a large\nshare of Indian B2B buyers will not fill a form \u00b7 offices + GSTIN \u00b7\nseparate dealership form\nWRITES  lead + lead_item[] + outbox, in ONE txn.  See \u00a76.",
