   "fontFamily": 3,
   "text": "v1 ships no price, because 0 of 5 audited sites publish one.\nYou asked to define this later \u2014 \u00a74 cuts the seam now so that\nswitching it on is a template change, not a migration.\nThe decision to make first: indicative, list, or dealer-only.\nRENDER  n/a in v1\nREADS   model.price_* columns, all NULL at launch",
   "originalText": "v1 ships no price, because 0 of 5 audited sites publish one.\nYou asked to define this later \u2014 \u00a74 cuts the seam now so that\nswitching it on is a template change, not a migration.\nThe decision to make first: indicative, list, or dealer-only.\nRENDER  n/a in v1\nREADS   model.price_* columns, all NULL at launch",
