   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fontSize": 11.5,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "text": "Thin, footer-linked. Must carry the \"specifications subject to\nchange without notice\" clause \u2014 all five audited sites have it \u2014\nplus a product-image disclaimer, an IP notice, and an India\ne-waste handling note as Blue Star carries.\nRENDER  SSG from MDX\nREADS   nothing",
   "originalText": "Thin, footer-linked. Must carry the \"specifications subject to\nchange without notice\" clause \u2014 all five audited sites have it \u2014\nplus a product-image disclaimer, an IP notice, and an India\ne-waste handling note as Blue Star carries.\nRENDER  SSG from MDX\nREADS   nothing",
