   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fontSize": 11.5,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "text": "Not a page anyone visits, and non-negotiable: this is HOW the\ncatalogue gets found at all. sitemap.xml + robots.txt are BUILT and\nlive, generated statically from APP_URL \u00b7 schema.org Product +\nOrganization + BreadcrumbList on every model page.\nRENDER  generated at build (no cron \u2014 a deploy is the refresh)\nREADS   catalog",
   "originalText": "Not a page anyone visits, and non-negotiable: this is HOW the\ncatalogue gets found at all. sitemap.xml + robots.txt are BUILT and\nlive, generated statically from APP_URL \u00b7 schema.org Product +\nOrganization + BreadcrumbList on every model page.\nRENDER  generated at build (no cron \u2014 a deploy is the refresh)\nREADS   catalog",
