   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fontSize": 12.5,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "Western Refrigeration, the Hoshizaki India arm and the closest comparable in the audit, also sells: visi coolers \u00b7 pastry and confectionery cabinets \u00b7 preparation tables \u00b7 back bars \u00b7 ice machines \u00b7 dishwashers \u00b7 glass washers \u00b7 medical refrigerators \u00b7 water coolers \u00b7 dispensers \u00b7 supermarket freezers \u00b7 vending machines.\nICE MACHINES ARE HOSHIZAKI'S FLAGSHIP PRODUCT WORLDWIDE. If they can be carried, they belong in the nav as a seventh category, not buried under an existing one.",
   "originalText": "Western Refrigeration, the Hoshizaki India arm and the closest comparable in the audit, also sells: visi coolers \u00b7 pastry and confectionery cabinets \u00b7 preparation tables \u00b7 back bars \u00b7 ice machines \u00b7 dishwashers \u00b7 glass washers \u00b7 medical refrigerators \u00b7 water coolers \u00b7 dispensers \u00b7 supermarket freezers \u00b7 vending machines.\nICE MACHINES ARE HOSHIZAKI'S FLAGSHIP PRODUCT WORLDWIDE. If they can be carried, they belong in the nav as a seventh category, not buried under an existing one.",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.42,
   "autoResize": false,
   "baseline": 10.0
  },
