   "fontFamily": 3,
   "text": " 1  Image gallery         4-6 photos: closed \u00b7 open and loaded \u00b7 interior \u00b7 controls \u00b7 in-situ.\n                          Plus a LINE DRAWING carrying the dimensions.\n 2  Model code + name     As the H1.   \"HR-78MA-S  \u00b7  Reach-In Refrigerator, Two Section, Solid Door\"\n 3  At-a-glance block     capacity (litres AND cu ft) \u00b7 temperature range degC \u00b7 exterior W x D x H in MM\n                          \u00b7 doors/sections \u00b7 refrigerant \u00b7 power.  Above the fold.\n 4  Primary CTAs          [ Request a Quote ]   [ Download Spec Sheet ]   both above the fold.  No price.\n 5  Cabinet construction  exterior/interior material and GRADE \u00b7 insulation type and thickness \u00b7 door type\n                          and reversibility \u00b7 lock \u00b7 shelves (count + finish) \u00b7 castors \u00b7 handle\n 6  Refrigeration system  refrigerant + compliance \u00b7 compressor type \u00b7 defrost method \u00b7 evaporator coating\n                          \u00b7 controller \u00b7 temperature uniformity\n 7  Specification table   11 rows minimum, + 5 more for India         -> panel, right\n 8  Downloads block       9 files per model                           -> panel, far right\n 9  Warranty              Stated ON the page, not buried. True leads with \"7-year parts, labour and\n                          compressor\" as a headline FEATURE, because it closes deals.\n10  Accessories           shelves \u00b7 castors \u00b7 drawer kits \u00b7 door locks\n11  Suitable for          industry tags, linking back to the Industries page\n12  Related models        3 cards \u2014 including the next size UP and the next size DOWN\n13  Enquiry form          inline at the bottom, model pre-filled.  Writes to \u00a76 step 2.",
   "originalText": " 1  Image gallery         4-6 photos: closed \u00b7 open and loaded \u00b7 interior \u00b7 controls \u00b7 in-situ.\n                          Plus a LINE DRAWING carrying the dimensions.\n 2  Model code + name     As the H1.   \"HR-78MA-S  \u00b7  Reach-In Refrigerator, Two Section, Solid Door\"\n 3  At-a-glance block     capacity (litres AND cu ft) \u00b7 temperature range degC \u00b7 exterior W x D x H in MM\n                          \u00b7 doors/sections \u00b7 refrigerant \u00b7 power.  Above the fold.\n 4  Primary CTAs          [ Request a Quote ]   [ Download Spec Sheet ]   both above the fold.  No price.\n 5  Cabinet construction  exterior/interior material and GRADE \u00b7 insulation type and thickness \u00b7 door type\n                          and reversibility \u00b7 lock \u00b7 shelves (count + finish) \u00b7 castors \u00b7 handle\n 6  Refrigeration system  refrigerant + compliance \u00b7 compressor type \u00b7 defrost method \u00b7 evaporator coating\n                          \u00b7 controller \u00b7 temperature uniformity\n 7  Specification table   11 rows minimum, + 5 more for India         -> panel, right\n 8  Downloads block       9 files per model                           -> panel, far right\n 9  Warranty              Stated ON the page, not buried. True leads with \"7-year parts, labour and\n                          compressor\" as a headline FEATURE, because it closes deals.\n10  Accessories           shelves \u00b7 castors \u00b7 drawer kits \u00b7 door locks\n11  Suitable for          industry tags, linking back to the Industries page\n12  Related models        3 cards \u2014 including the next size UP and the next size DOWN\n13  Enquiry form          inline at the bottom, model pre-filled.  Writes to \u00a76 step 2.",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
