   "id": "el-0083",
   "seed": 1538285792,
   "versionNonce": 1215334952,
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1554,
   "y": 2021.7699999999998,
   "width": 1352,
   "height": 212.29,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fontSize": 11.5,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "text": "NINE FILES PER MODEL   (what Beverage-Air actually ships)\n  spec sheet PDF           manual PDF            brochure PDF\n  warranty statement PDF   product video         Revit / BIM\n  AutoCAD front .dwg       AutoCAD plan          AutoCAD side\n\nFour of the nine is already strong. Omitting the spec sheet is\nthe single most common reason a B2B refrigeration enquiry never\nhappens \u2014 the purchase manager cannot put a web page in a tender.\n\nAll nine live in Cloudflare R2 and the page links them directly.\nR2 egress is free at any volume, so the heavy bytes never touch\nthe host's bandwidth quota.  Store per RANGE, not per SKU:\n~80 PDFs, not 700.",
   "originalText": "NINE FILES PER MODEL   (what Beverage-Air actually ships)\n  spec sheet PDF           manual PDF            brochure PDF\n  warranty statement PDF   product video         Revit / BIM\n  AutoCAD front .dwg       AutoCAD plan          AutoCAD side\n\nFour of the nine is already strong. Omitting the spec sheet is\nthe single most common reason a B2B refrigeration enquiry never\nhappens \u2014 the purchase manager cannot put a web page in a tender.\n\nAll nine live in Cloudflare R2 and the page links them directly.\nR2 egress is free at any volume, so the heavy bytes never touch\nthe host's bandwidth quota.  Store per RANGE, not per SKU:\n~80 PDFs, not 700.",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.42,
   "autoResize": false,
   "baseline": 9.200000000000001
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "version": 1,
   "id": "el-0084",
   "seed": 676023924,
   "versionNonce": 198820068,
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 2308.0599999999995,
   "width": 2920,
   "height": 28.799999999999997,
   "strokeColor": "#1a1d23",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fontSize": 24,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "4 \u00b7 Pricing \u2014 deferred by decision, pre-cut by design",
   "originalText": "4 \u00b7 Pricing \u2014 deferred by decision, pre-cut by design",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.2,
   "autoResize": false,
   "baseline": 19.200000000000003
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "version": 1,
   "id": "el-0085",
   "seed": 780002753,
   "versionNonce": 887727879,
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 2342.8599999999997,
   "width": 2920,
   "height": 19.599999999999998,
   "strokeColor": "#6c757d",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "You asked for a price section. The honest position: 0 of the 5 audited sites publish a price, so v1 ships none. What follows is the seam, cut now, so that turning pricing on later costs a template change rather than a migration.",
   "originalText": "You asked for a price section. The honest position: 0 of the 5 audited sites publish a price, so v1 ships none. What follows is the seam, cut now, so that turning pricing on later costs a template change rather than a migration.",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.4,
   "autoResize": false,
   "baseline": 11.200000000000001
  },
