   "id": "el-0093",
   "seed": 1945675848,
   "versionNonce": 1246666630,
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1484.0,
   "y": 2396.4599999999996,
   "width": 687.0,
   "height": 18.91,
   "strokeColor": "#1a1d23",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fontSize": 15.5,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "The seam \u2014 cut it now, costs nothing",
   "originalText": "The seam \u2014 cut it now, costs nothing",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.22,
   "autoResize": false,
   "baseline": 12.4
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "version": 1,
   "id": "el-0094",
   "seed": 1839037763,
   "versionNonce": 1810950290,
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1484.0,
   "y": 2423.3699999999994,
   "width": 687.0,
   "height": 261.28,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fontSize": 11.5,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "text": "ON model:\n  price_minor        bigint  NULL    paise, never float\n  currency           char(3) DEFAULT 'INR'\n  price_visibility   enum('hidden','indicative','list',\n                          'dealer')  DEFAULT 'hidden'\n  price_valid_from   date    NULL\n  tax_note           text    NULL    \"GST extra\"\n\nON the template:\n  one <PriceSlot/> that renders NOTHING while visibility\n  = 'hidden'. Ships in v1, renders in v2, no redeploy of\n  the data model.\n\nON the enquiry:\n  lead_item already carries model + quantity (\u00a76 step 2).\n  That IS the quote request. Nothing to add.",
   "originalText": "ON model:\n  price_minor        bigint  NULL    paise, never float\n  currency           char(3) DEFAULT 'INR'\n  price_visibility   enum('hidden','indicative','list',\n                          'dealer')  DEFAULT 'hidden'\n  price_valid_from   date    NULL\n  tax_note           text    NULL    \"GST extra\"\n\nON the template:\n  one <PriceSlot/> that renders NOTHING while visibility\n  = 'hidden'. Ships in v1, renders in v2, no redeploy of\n  the data model.\n\nON the enquiry:\n  lead_item already carries model + quantity (\u00a76 step 2).\n  That IS the quote request. Nothing to add.",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.42,
   "autoResize": false,
   "baseline": 9.200000000000001
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
