   "id": "el-0101",
   "seed": 1444864422,
   "versionNonce": 954563631,
   "type": "text",
   "x": 14,
   "y": 2856.1899999999996,
   "width": 1472,
   "height": 238.56,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "text": "FACET                   VALUES\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nProduct type            Refrigerator \u00b7 Freezer \u00b7 Dual-temp \u00b7 Convertible\nConfiguration           Upright/reach-in \u00b7 Undercounter \u00b7 Worktop \u00b7 Drawer \u00b7\n                        Glass door \u00b7 Display case \u00b7 Chest \u00b7 Walk-in\nSections / doors        1 \u00b7 2 \u00b7 3 \u00b7 4+\nDoor type               Solid stainless \u00b7 Half door \u00b7 Full glass \u00b7 Sliding \u00b7 Drawer\nCapacity                LITRES (range slider); cu ft shown secondary\nTemperature range       +2 to +8 degC \u00b7 -18 to -22 degC \u00b7 -40 degC \u00b7 -60 degC \u00b7 dual\nExterior width          MM (range slider)\nRefrigerant             R290 \u00b7 R600a \u00b7 R134a \u00b7 R404A\nFinish                  SS 304 \u00b7 SS 430 \u00b7 Powder-coated\nPower                   230 V single phase \u00b7 415 V three phase\nIndustry                the six sections from the Industries page",
   "originalText": "FACET                   VALUES\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nProduct type            Refrigerator \u00b7 Freezer \u00b7 Dual-temp \u00b7 Convertible\nConfiguration           Upright/reach-in \u00b7 Undercounter \u00b7 Worktop \u00b7 Drawer \u00b7\n                        Glass door \u00b7 Display case \u00b7 Chest \u00b7 Walk-in\nSections / doors        1 \u00b7 2 \u00b7 3 \u00b7 4+\nDoor type               Solid stainless \u00b7 Half door \u00b7 Full glass \u00b7 Sliding \u00b7 Drawer\nCapacity                LITRES (range slider); cu ft shown secondary\nTemperature range       +2 to +8 degC \u00b7 -18 to -22 degC \u00b7 -40 degC \u00b7 -60 degC \u00b7 dual\nExterior width          MM (range slider)\nRefrigerant             R290 \u00b7 R600a \u00b7 R134a \u00b7 R404A\nFinish                  SS 304 \u00b7 SS 430 \u00b7 Powder-coated\nPower                   230 V single phase \u00b7 415 V three phase\nIndustry                the six sections from the Industries page",
   "textAlign": "left",
