   "id": "el-0191",
   "seed": 1505396162,
   "versionNonce": 1483973954,
   "type": "text",
   "x": 210.0,
   "y": 4779.165,
   "width": 716.6666666666666,
   "height": 146.97,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fontSize": 11.5,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "1 GB storage  \u00b7  100 CU-HOURS/month  \u00b7  scale-to-zero after 5 min,\nCANNOT be disabled  \u00b7  10 branches  \u00b7  6 h history  \u00b7  NO backups\n\nTHE BINDING LIMIT IS COMPUTE, NOT STORAGE:\n100 CU-h / 0.25 CU = 400 h active per month out of 720.\nAny poll tighter than ~15 min keeps it awake 24/7 = 1.8x over.\n=> on-demand ISR only, a Redis-gated sweeper, and a filter UI\n   that resolves client-side. The DB sleeps between writes.\nProjected: 61 of 100 CU-hours.",
   "originalText": "1 GB storage  \u00b7  100 CU-HOURS/month  \u00b7  scale-to-zero after 5 min,\nCANNOT be disabled  \u00b7  10 branches  \u00b7  6 h history  \u00b7  NO backups\n\nTHE BINDING LIMIT IS COMPUTE, NOT STORAGE:\n100 CU-h / 0.25 CU = 400 h active per month out of 720.\nAny poll tighter than ~15 min keeps it awake 24/7 = 1.8x over.\n=> on-demand ISR only, a Redis-gated sweeper, and a filter UI\n   that resolves client-side. The DB sleeps between writes.\nProjected: 61 of 100 CU-hours.",
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.42,
   "autoResize": false,
   "baseline": 9.200000000000001
  },
