   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "10 GB-month, egress free.\n\nproducts/  1.7 GB  (5 AVIF widths,\n   2400px master IS the original)\ndocs/      2.5 GB  (spec sheets,\n   manuals, CAD -- per RANGE,\n   ~80 PDFs not 700)\ncv/        1.2 GB  (12-mo lifecycle\n   delete = DPDP retention)\nbackups/   1.0 GB  (30 nightly dumps)\narchive/   0.2 GB\nheadroom   3.4 GB",
