   "fontSize": 11.5,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "500K commands/month, 256 MB.\n\nTHE RULE: a page view never touches\nRedis and never touches Postgres.\n\nWrites only:\n \u00b7 rate-limit buckets      36k/mo\n \u00b7 idempotency keys         5k/mo\n \u00b7 outbox work-pending flag 3k/mo\n \u00b7 WhatsApp + Resend quota\n   counters                 5k/mo\n   = 49k of 500k  (10%)",
   "originalText": "500K commands/month, 256 MB.\n\nTHE RULE: a page view never touches\nRedis and never touches Postgres.\n\nWrites only:\n \u00b7 rate-limit buckets      36k/mo\n \u00b7 idempotency keys         5k/mo\n \u00b7 outbox work-pending flag 3k/mo\n \u00b7 WhatsApp + Resend quota\n   counters                 5k/mo\n   = 49k of 500k  (10%)",
