   "id": "el-0328",
   "seed": 732440021,
   "versionNonce": 683165220,
   "type": "text",
   "x": 14,
   "y": 6392.27,
   "width": 1402,
   "height": 460.08,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "text": "ADD WHEN THE CONTENT EXISTS, NOT BEFORE\n---------------------------------------------------------------------\n10  Dealer / network locator          4/5 of the sites have one, and\n    in India the dealer IS the buying channel. Blocked only on having\n    dealers to list. Promote it to v1 the day the list exists -- an\n    empty map is worse than no map.\n\n11  Why Us / Technology               Traulsen runs five such pages\n    (temperature-airflow, smart-control, stayclear-condenser-coil,\n    ez-clean-gasket, ezclean-trayracks). Only worth building when the\n    claims are real and the test data exists. Invented\n    differentiators are worse than none.\n\n12  Installations / case studies      HIGH VALUE, 1/5 convergence --\n    only Blue Star has it, which is the opportunity rather than a\n    reason to skip. A bakery owner seeing three bakeries you have\n    fitted out beats any amount of copy.\n    START PHOTOGRAPHING INSTALLATIONS NOW, before the page exists.\n\n13  News & Insights                   Conditional on publishing\n    monthly for a year. Western's blog is the model: every post is a\n    product page in disguise, tagged to the product it sells. A blog\n    whose newest post is 14 months old actively damages trust.\n\n14  Careers                           Expected (5/5) but serves\n    recruitment, not customers. \"Write to careers@\" is an acceptable\n    v1. Do not let it compete with the product template for effort.",
   "originalText": "ADD WHEN THE CONTENT EXISTS, NOT BEFORE\n---------------------------------------------------------------------\n10  Dealer / network locator          4/5 of the sites have one, and\n    in India the dealer IS the buying channel. Blocked only on having\n    dealers to list. Promote it to v1 the day the list exists -- an\n    empty map is worse than no map.\n\n11  Why Us / Technology               Traulsen runs five such pages\n    (temperature-airflow, smart-control, stayclear-condenser-coil,\n    ez-clean-gasket, ezclean-trayracks). Only worth building when the\n    claims are real and the test data exists. Invented\n    differentiators are worse than none.\n\n12  Installations / case studies      HIGH VALUE, 1/5 convergence --\n    only Blue Star has it, which is the opportunity rather than a\n    reason to skip. A bakery owner seeing three bakeries you have\n    fitted out beats any amount of copy.\n    START PHOTOGRAPHING INSTALLATIONS NOW, before the page exists.\n\n13  News & Insights                   Conditional on publishing\n    monthly for a year. Western's blog is the model: every post is a\n    product page in disguise, tagged to the product it sells. A blog\n    whose newest post is 14 months old actively damages trust.\n\n14  Careers                           Expected (5/5) but serves\n    recruitment, not customers. \"Write to careers@\" is an acceptable\n    v1. Do not let it compete with the product template for effort.",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.42,
   "autoResize": false,
   "baseline": 9.600000000000001
