   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "Legend: green = free and comfortable, or a must-have that is settled \u00b7 amber = free but close to a limit, a deferred decision, or a known degradation \u00b7 red = blocked, non-compliant, or deliberately not built \u00b7 blue/teal = render and web tier \u00b7 pink = module boundary. Convergence counts and page contents trace to docs/ia/SITE-SECTIONS-REPORT.md. All provider quotas verified 2026-10-07 and subject to change.",
   "originalText": "Legend: green = free and comfortable, or a must-have that is settled \u00b7 amber = free but close to a limit, a deferred decision, or a known degradation \u00b7 red = blocked, non-compliant, or deliberately not built \u00b7 blue/teal = render and web tier \u00b7 pink = module boundary. Convergence counts and page contents trace to docs/ia/SITE-SECTIONS-REPORT.md. All provider quotas verified 2026-10-07 and subject to change.",
